\import{fdip-macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}
\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Definition}
\title{The bulk integer}
\date{2026-11-27}

\p{On the \vocabk{simplicial momentum grid}{fdip-013X}, take a Clifford symbol as in \ref{fdip-0141} with centered coefficients #{f} and real mass #{m}. Assume that each vertex zero of #{f} is a \vocabk{nondegenerate vertex zero}{fdip-013Y}. Its \newvocab{bulk integer} is
##{\kappa=\sum_{v\,:\,f(v)=0,\,m(v)<0}\deg_v f.}
For a constant mass shift #{M}, write #{\kappa(M)} when the mass in the sum is the unshifted mass minus #{M}.}
